# Normalise line endings.
#
# The Git for Windows installer sets core.autocrlf=true system-wide, which would
# check every text file out as CRLF while CI (ubuntu-latest) and Prettier both
# work in LF. Without this file the whole working tree shows as modified after a
# fresh clone on Windows. `text=auto eol=lf` stores and checks out LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.db binary
*.db-shm binary
*.db-wal binary
*.one binary
*.onetoc2 binary

